interpolated, trusted:  <p>Vue 3.5 &amp; the template</p>
interpolated, hostile:  <p>&lt;img src=x onerror=&quot;steal()&quot;&gt;</p>
v-html, hostile:        <p><img src=x onerror="steal()"></p>
interpolation produced a tag: false
v-html produced a tag: true
an ampersand survives interpolation as text: true
